cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or refer to River Watch, please cite it as below."
title: "River Watch: automated Sentinel-2 monitoring of water hyacinth and muddy water on Pune's rivers"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "RIG Consultancy"
repository-code: "https://github.com/rig-consultancy/river-watch"
license-url: "https://github.com/rig-consultancy/river-watch/blob/main/LICENSE"
abstract: >-
  Fully automated monitoring of floating vegetation (water hyacinth) and muddy water on the
  Mula-Mutha, Pawana and Indrayani rivers from Sentinel-2 L2A images, from 2017 onward. Weed is
  measured as the covered share of each 10 m pixel, the river area is derived from the image
  history, and a post-monsoon flood test separates floating weed from rooted vegetation. Figures
  are cross-checked against Landsat 8/9 and a planted-weed test.
keywords:
  - water hyacinth
  - Sentinel-2
  - remote sensing
  - river monitoring
  - Pune
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-11-12"
